UTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 a05b2ae4-b462-4f26-8376-087ae6ad47bb / v5：对应本次当前结果\n\n5. \"LOCAL_CASE_RECORD_RECHECK\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 d5d4e870-8db6-4b76-a9f6-670162f61949 / v6：对应本次当前结果\n\n资格：NOT_EVALUATED；外部受理：NOT_SUBMITTED；线下履约：NO_EVIDENCE；Case目标未完成。\n原采用来源和旧计划只作为历史引用；当前所有目标均在上方保留。\n原行/原来源指纹引用原接口完整投影；导出的白名单子对象不用于重算这些原指纹。下方整包核对数据指纹可按JSON规范化重算。\n核对数据 SHA256：271f73f84f7ea4ae65cc2ce1964f7fe5e5f27cc5d81f2c9787e6ab6049e4b597\n核对数据（UTF-8 JSON，原文按JSON转义；不包含读取凭据）：\n{\n  \"actor_id\": \"fixture-a\",\n  \"preparation_id\": \"8d1f06eb-3dca-4d76-bd70-1773926b657e\",\n  \"case_id\": \"e769a510-031b-4906-a01e-e902e6883060\",\n  \"run_id\": \"6bddd6af-479e-4346-8428-3bd5d3c8e462\",\n  \"preparation_revision\": 8,\n  \"request_revision\": 6,\n  \"current_request\": \"SYNTHETIC current ordinary outputs\",\n  \"original_request\": \"PRIVATE_REQUEST_A\",\n  \"plan_id\": \"28587a07-24b1-402b-9761-b286358cbf31\",\n  \"plan_revision\": 6,\n  \"state\": \"LOCAL_OUTPUTS_VERIFIED\",\n  \"read_only\": true,\n  \"automatically_verified\": false,\n  \"case_goal_completed\": false,\n  \"qualification\": \"NOT_EVALUATED\",\n  \"external_acceptance\": \"NOT_SUBMITTED\",\n  \"offline_fulfillment\": \"NO_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_CASE_RECORD_PACK_V1\",\n  \"source_scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_ADOPTED_LOCAL_GOAL_RESULTS_ONLY\",\n  \"current_required_goals\": [\n    \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_CASE_RESOURCE_ASSOCIATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_INTERNAL_ACCEPTANCE\",\n    \"LOCAL_SYNTHETIC_RECEIPT_ACKNOWLEDGEMENT\",\n    \"LOCAL_CASE_RECORD_RECHECK\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"goal\": \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\",\n      \"title\": \"当前材料的人工核对与企业确认\",\n      \"adapter_id\": \"P1\",\n      \"step_id\": \"de5e7e7b-ce3b-45dc-9e64-3765f2236e37\",\n      \"state\": \"LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\",\n      \"next_action\": null,\n      \"adoption_trace_sha256\": \"39970377d05108646bef34a2278